{"branch":"별가람점","html":"<section id=\"selected-directions\" class=\"km-directions\" aria-labelledby=\"selected-directions-title\" data-km-branch=\"별가람점\"><h3 id=\"selected-directions-title\">찾아오시는 길</h3><p class=\"km-intro\">별가람점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"km-map\" data-state=\"waiting\"><iframe data-km-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/maps/39sjyzhrgcp.htm\" title=\"별가람점 카카오 지도\" width=\"800\" height=\"398\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe><p class=\"km-map-status\">카카오 지도</p></div><div class=\"km-details\"><dl><dt>주소</dt><dd>경기 남양주시 덕송1로55번길 20 503호</dd></dl><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 지하철</h4><ul><li><span class=\"km-line\">수도권 4호선</span>별내별가람역</li></ul></section><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 정류장</h4><ul><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">1</span>별내별가람역3번출구.별가람마을.단독3블록</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">2</span>별내별가람역4번출구.별가람마을.단독3블록</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">3</span>별내별가람역.남양주보훈요양원</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">4</span>별내별가람역2번출구.남양주보훈요양원</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">5</span>퍼스트포레.별가람마을1-8</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">6</span>퍼스트포레.별가람마을1-8</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">7</span>덕송초등학교</li></ul></section><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 버스</h4><ul class=\"km-buses\"><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0106\">일반</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>땡큐50</span><span>땡큐51</span><span>81</span></span></li><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0109\">마을</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>80</span><span>82A</span><span>82B</span><span>85-1</span><span>86</span><span>땡큐20</span><span>땡큐85</span><span>48</span><span>48-1</span></span></li><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0110\">직행</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>1001</span></span></li></ul></section><p class=\"km-traffic-note\">주변 교통 정보는 제공된 카카오맵 약도 기준입니다. 노선과 정차 여부는 운행 상황에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.</p></div></sect